---
import { hiddenCosts } from "../../content/home";
---

<section class="section problem" id="problem">
  <div class="section-intro">
    <p class="section-context">A busy booth can still lose money.</p>
    <h2>
      Sales are easy to count. Profit is the operating record around them.
    </h2>
    <p>
      A POS total cannot tell you whether a location worked when the expenses
      and stock changes live in separate notes, chats, photos, and spreadsheets.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="cost-ledger" aria-label="Costs included in location profit">
    <div class="ledger-heading">
      <span>What the shift must account for</span>
      <strong>Beyond sales</strong>
    </div>
    <dl>
      {
        hiddenCosts.map(([term, detail]) => (
          <div>
            <dt>{term}</dt>
            <dd>{detail}</dd>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </dl>
    <p class="ledger-result">
      The result is a location decision, not another report to interpret.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
